Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伊利诺伊州  橡树园)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(一周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(浮士德博士)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(十字路口魔鬼)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(非常七人组)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(内布拉斯加州  林肯近郊)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(水管清洁剂)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得继承他的遗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to carry out his legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means hunting down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能猎杀多少凶鬼恶灵杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜  你要拿自己的灵魂换吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, you're offering up your own soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要复活萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你一年  就一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you one year and one year only.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你企图想办法钻空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try and welch or weasel your way out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.15,0:01:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那交易取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the deal is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有多确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How certain are you 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that what you brought back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是百分百纯粹的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 100 percent pure Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是魔鬼之门  地狱的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Devil's Gate, a damn door to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope to hell you boys are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为战争刚打响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the war's just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍比  - 你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又埋头看那本书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You buried in that book again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  你想打破迪恩的恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you wanna break Dean free of that demon deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是不会写在哪本书里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ain't gonna find the answer in no book.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要去哪找  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子  我知道就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哥哥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 做民调呢  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Polling the electorate. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you boys better pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能终于有所发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I finally found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  你醒着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比打来了  他觉得我们可能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby called and he thinks that maybe we...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把眼睛挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can gouge my eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是种美妙自然的行为  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful, natural act, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不想看到你那个样子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a part of you I never wanted to see, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你让我跟绿箭双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate you giving me a little quality time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共度美妙时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Doublemint Twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得说  我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say, I was expecting a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会疲倦地叹气  或翻白眼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}weary sigh or an eye roll. Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有权享乐一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve to have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我非常同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm in violent agreement with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍比查到了什么  - 不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's Bobby got? - Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内布拉斯加州林肯近郊有作物枯萎和蝉群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crop failure and a cicada swarm outside of Lincoln, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是恶魔预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it could be demonic omens...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能只是作物和虫害问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it could just be a bad crop and a bug problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但这是我们唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But it's our only lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有怪异死亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any freaky deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比是没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing Bobby could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 至少暂时还没有  - 好奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not yet, anyway. - It's weird, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鬼之门打开那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the night the Devil's Gate opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少座城市上空\N{\fnArial\fs30}all these weird old storm clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了奇怪的暴雨云\N{\fnArial\fs30}were sighted over how many cities?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 17座  - 17座\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seventeen. - Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按说早该是《现代启示录》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think it'd be Apocalypse Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这都五天了  还什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been five days and bupkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔在等什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the demons waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直要把我逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你  如果战争要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, if it's gonna be war,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望它赶紧开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it'd just start already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许错愿要后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到那蝉鸣了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear those cicadas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那绝不是好兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that can't be a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早餐就吃上培根奶酪汉堡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're eating bacon cheeseburgers for breakfast, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卖了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩一年活头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a year to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不担心胆固醇什么的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't sweating the cholesterol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Bobby, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是发生圣经里那样的瘟疫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a biblical plague here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里似乎是蝉群聚集的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the swarm's ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candygram!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这绝对不是好兆头  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That so can't be a good sign. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这本该是我的生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to be my birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶在列宾客名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma is making out the invitation list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏·艾伦要雇...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue Ellen is gonna hire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍比  这是怎么回事  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby, what the hell happened here? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- JR要用...  - 看看有没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And J.R. is gonna use this... - Check for sulphur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很盛大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要买我的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're gonna buy my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨这个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克  塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac? Tamara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  你怎么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我也想问你们呢  - 你好吗  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could ask the same. - How are you, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleeding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮  是吗  名字好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Jenny, is it? That is a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妹妹也叫这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my sister's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的声音跟你也像\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sounds like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣檀木呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Palo Santo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where'd you leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  亲爱的  所以才问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, dear, that's why I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣檀木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palo Santo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是圣木\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's holy wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对恶魔有毒  就像圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's toxic to demons, like holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能钉住那些混蛋  让你有时间驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps the bastards nailed down while you're exorcising them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没有我  你连脑袋都能丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd lose your head if it wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们结婚多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long you two been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到6月有八年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years this past June.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起猎魔的家庭...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family that slays together...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  这我有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, I'm with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么入行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd you get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我不该...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不该问  - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's none of my business. - No, no, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮  如果你人有声音那么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jenny, if you, uh, look as pretty as you sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我很想跟你一起喝苹果马丁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'd love to have an appletini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  再联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是死因裁判官的技术员  - 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was the coroner's tech. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一家人  死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole family, cause of death:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱水和饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dehydration and starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有捆绑迹象  没有暴力和挣扎的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no signs of restraint. No violence. No struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就坐下  然后再没起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just sat down and never got up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但几步之外的厨房里就有充足的食物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was a fully-stocked kitchen just yards away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  怎么回事  恶魔袭击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. What is this, a demon attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是  我是没见过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is, it's not like anything I ever saw
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可见过不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've seen plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办  我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what now? What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不做什么  - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not gonna do anything. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看上去不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys seem nice enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这可不是《史酷比狗》\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this ain't Scooby-Doo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不怎么跟其他人合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we don't play well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们如果合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we'd cover a lot more ground
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能更高效些\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we all worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可不要跟打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not teaming with the damned fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鬼之门的蠢货合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}who let the Devil's Gate get opened in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还无意冒犯呢  - 艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No offense? - Isaac.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道没犯过错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you've never made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钥匙锁在车里过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked my keys in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把白衣服洗成粉的过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned my laundry pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没带来过世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never brought on the end of the world, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  这样没什么好处  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this isn't helping. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  现在外面还有几百个恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there are a couple hundred more demons out there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候会出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they'll strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界的猎人加起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't enough hunters in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不足以应付这种局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}to handle something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我们带来了战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought war down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们所有人  - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On all of us. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的大男子主义真是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite enough testosterone for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.69,0:13:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有34号的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got it in a 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 行吗  - 应该行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that all right? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那鞋真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are nice shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那鞋真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are nice shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想要  - 抱歉  最后一双了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want them. - Sorry, last pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要那双鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want those shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you crazy? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  干什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概10分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最好叫格里瑟姆来  - 查查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think you better call Grissom. - Check that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what happened outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人意识到生命多么脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you realize how fragile life really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不能浪费人生的一分一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make every second count.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪一下  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me a minute, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安慰伤心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comforting the bereaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么  - 工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死尸  可能是恶魔袭击  什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead body. Possible demon attack, that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.67,0:14:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  抱歉  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm sorry. It's just, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我时日无多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much time left, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能浪费一分一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta make every second count.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  - 接受你的道歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾得这么干净  鲍比  你是探员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking spiffy, Bobby. What were you, a G-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚从地检官办公室来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returning from the DA's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟嫌疑人谈过了  - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just spoke to the suspect. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是被附身了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she possessed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有任何一般的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's none of the usual signs. No
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没断片  没失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}blackouts, no loss of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全清醒  她就是特想要那双鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally lucid. Just think she really wanted those shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还洒了她一身圣水  以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spilled a glass of holy water on her, just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许她就是个普通的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe she's just some random whack job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是独立事件还有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it had been an isolated incident, maybe. But
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但先是那一家  现在又这一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}first the family, now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不包括巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coincidence ain't one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you boys find anything around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulphur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么都没有  - 或许有点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - Well, maybe something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might just be a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it might be our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午夜12:07\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven past midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定我们找对地方了吗  - 不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure this is the right place? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我一整天都拿这家伙的丑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I spent all day canvassing this stupid town...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这破地方到处打听\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this guy's stupid mug and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说他在这家破酒吧喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposedly he drinks at this stupid bar...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不好笑  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not funny. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:17:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无名氏叫沃特·罗森\N{\fnArial\fs30}So John Doe's name is, uh, Walter Rosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自芝加哥以西的橡树园\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's from Oak Park just west of Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概一周前失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went missing about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 魔鬼之门打开那晚吗  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The night the Devil's Gate opened? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think he's possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a good bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  他走到一个人面前  摸下那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, he just walks up to someone, touches them...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人就变成疯子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they go stark raving psycho or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些冲出了大门的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those demons that got out of that Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定有各种我们没见识过的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna be able to do all kinds of things we haven't seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们放出来的那些恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, the demons we let out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  上场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道这人有什么本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what to expect out of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该跟踪他  探探虚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should tail him till we know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  他杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he kills someone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们只闲坐在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we just sit here with our junk in our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们死了更没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no good dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不清楚情况  就不能轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make a move untill we know what the score is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  那办法恐怕不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I don't think that's an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 多谢  - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks a lot. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把车开到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the car in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就能完事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是去解手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just hitting the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么跑来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢我的酒吧里有猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like hunters in my bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计  你真是来错了地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you really walked into the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢那女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要个那样的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I had me a girl like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能想到上千件我想对她做的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could think of about a thousand things I'd like to do to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脏手别想碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna lay one filthy finger on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝点吧  我请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a drink on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.41,0:20:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克  不要  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac, no! Baby, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  亲爱的  该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, honey. Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾萨克  不要  - 来  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isaac! No! - Come on, we gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  他死了  - 艾萨克  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, he's dead, he's dead. - Isaac, no, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上车  - 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in the car. - Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾萨克  - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isaac! Isaac! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  我们要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say we're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下我丈夫在地上流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left my husband bloody on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我明白  但我们不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I understand that, but we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要回酒吧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm heading back to that bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我陪她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是自杀  迪恩  - 那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's suicide, Dean. - So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我反正也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也不会一个个等着被驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not just gonna wait in line to get exorcised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不在乎  - 我们都不知道他们有多少个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care! - We don't even know how many of them there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道我们面对的是什么情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea who we're up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.43,0:21:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七宗罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seven deadly sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们鲜活的本尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live and in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"盒子里是什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's in the box?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉德·皮特的《七宗罪》  没看过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brad Pitt? Se7en? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么  - 《宾斯费尔德恶魔分类》\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - Binsfeld Classification of Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1589年  宾斯费尔德确认了七宗罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1589, Binsfeld ID'd the seven sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是人性缺点  还是真正的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just as human vices, but as actual devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.75,0:22:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家人  他们被懒惰碰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family. They were touched by Sloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个购物者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the shopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.79,0:22:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是嫉妒干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Envy's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们旁边房间里那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The customer we got in the next room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我起初无法判断  直到艾萨克的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't suss it out at first, until Isaac.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被贪食碰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was touched with an awful gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a rat's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是三个臭皮匠还是四顶尖合唱团\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they're the Three Stooges or the Four Tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把他们都杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna slaughter every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经按你的方式试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already did it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备不充分就冲了进去  结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burst in there half-cocked and look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.94,0:22:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些恶魔都有五百年没上来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These demons haven't been top side in half a millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.15,0:22:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是中世纪  黑暗时代的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking medieval, Dark Ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本没应付过类似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never faced anything close to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们要缓一缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are gonna take a breath...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:23:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想好接下来该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}and figure out what our next move is!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.33,0:23:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你的丧亲表示遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道我是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know who I am, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我们没觉得有啥了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do. We're not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他问你问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.83,0:23:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经得到我们想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already have what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.35,0:24:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们  到处都是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you, my kind are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我名叫群  因为我们数目众多"(马可福音)\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am legion, for we are many."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我只是在庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So me, I'm just celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开心  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fun? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.83,0:24:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人喜欢钩针编织  有些人喜欢打高尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, some people crochet, others golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.54,0:24:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢看人的里子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to see people's insides...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.30,0:24:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻到外面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}on their outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.39,0:24:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要像杀狗一样杀了你  - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna put you down like a dog. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.85,0:24:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真觉得你们比我强吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you're better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.27,0:24:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们谁是无罪之人  能丢第一块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you can cast the first stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:24:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你几乎是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're practically a...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行走的贪食和淫欲的广告牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A walking billboard of gluttony and lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.95,0:25:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么多愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that wrath?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是你和艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the reason you and Isaac
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.54,0:25:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为猎人的原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}became hunters in the first place, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.13,0:25:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为沉溺于愤怒之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so much easier to drink in the rage...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要比面对多年前的真相轻松得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to face what really happened all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.06,0:25:33.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说中了吧  你们还说我们是罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point exactly. And you call us sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.73,0:25:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才不是罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sins, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.48,0:25:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是自然的人类直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are natural human instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你们怎么压抑  否认我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can repress and deny us all you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.86,0:25:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但事实就是  你们只是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth is, you are just animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淫荡  贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horny, greedy...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.17,0:25:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}violent animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.96,0:26:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也会如动物般被屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be slaughtered like animals too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.43,0:26:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.19,0:26:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.19,0:26:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们别想找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're not gonna find you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.44,0:26:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你要下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you'll be in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁送这小丑上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone send this clown packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.95,0:26:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们恐怕不需要担心怎么猎他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we're gonna have to worry about hunting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.43,0:26:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那小丑可能说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe this joker's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.68,0:26:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会来猎我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be hunting us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会轻易放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're not gonna quit easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们带上塔玛拉跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, why don't you take Tamara and head for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.10,0:26:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下  拖住他们  争取时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay back, slow them down, buy a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.73,0:27:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just forget about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.15,0:27:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.24,0:27:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有六个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's six of them, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们寡不敌众  武力不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're outmanned, we're outgunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.53,0:27:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天明前就会被团灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be dead by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.91,0:27:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧  但我们跑去哪都会被他们找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but there's no place to run that they won't find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.99,0:27:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  如果我们要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we're going down,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.58,0:27:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也要死在一起  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going down together, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们别让他们太轻松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's not make it easy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔被逐出那人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon's out of the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.72,0:27:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.67,0:28:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.26,0:28:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.35,0:28:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.19,0:29:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跑出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got away,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.78,0:29:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm hurt bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.49,0:29:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要救助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.37,0:29:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有个恶魔附身了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those demons is possessing his corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.77,0:29:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.04,0:29:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不放我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you let me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.96,0:29:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚丢下了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me behind back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.21,0:29:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.63,0:29:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发过誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We swore
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.84,0:29:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在密歇根州的那座湖边  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}at that lake in Michigan, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.97,0:29:39.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发誓绝不抛下彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We swore we would never leave each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.68,0:29:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他怎么会知道  - 别冲动  塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did he know that? - Steady, Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.89,0:29:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别冲动  塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, Tamara, steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.23,0:29:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要把我丢在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna leave me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.90,0:29:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要任我死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna let me die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.99,0:29:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是这种人吧  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's what you'd do, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.95,0:29:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像那晚  那些玩意冲进了我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that night those things came to our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.66,0:30:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了我们的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came for our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也任她死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just let her die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.67,0:30:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.92,0:30:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.55,0:30:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Isaac.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.24,0:30:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人这辈子可不该又胖又醉又傻  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat, drunk and stupid is no way to go through life, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.22,0:31:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是淫欲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you're Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.10,0:31:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  你希望我是什么我就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I'm whatever you want me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.11,0:31:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  别过来  - 否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, all right. Just stay back. - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.61,0:31:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你希望我伤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless you want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.62,0:31:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰尼来了（出自《闪灵》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.09,0:31:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真觉得那样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.18,0:31:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能骗过我这样的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna fool someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.31,0:31:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.47,0:31:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.89,0:31:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.90,0:31:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万罪之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}The root of all sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}are Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.03,0:32:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.53,0:32:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.29,0:32:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Boy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你这幅样子  我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at you now, I gotta tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别信那些吹捧\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't believe the hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.55,0:32:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我会向你这样的可怜虫人类俯首称臣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm gonna bow to a cut-rate, piss-poor human like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.26,0:32:20.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是有骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my pride, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.89,0:32:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的黄眼朋友也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now with your yellow-eyed friend dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.56,0:32:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我什么都不用做了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I don't really have to do a damn thing, now, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.98,0:32:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在是众矢之的  人人可杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fair game now, boy, and it's open season.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.06,0:33:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.10,0:33:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.42,0:33:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是刚救了你的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the girl that just saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.84,0:33:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just saved yours too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.93,0:33:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回见了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.55,0:33:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得她会没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think she's gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.89,0:34:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你气色好差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look like hell warmed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试试驱魔一整夜  看你什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you try exorcising all night, see how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有活下来的吗  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any survivors, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.73,0:34:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个漂亮姑娘和胖小子能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the pretty girl and the heavy guy. They'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.99,0:34:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做一辈子心理咨询了  但总算能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifetime of therapy bills ahead, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.49,0:34:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些可怜虫就惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than you can say for these poor bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.16,0:34:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比  那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.54,0:34:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的刀能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of blade can kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.54,0:34:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的话  我会说没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I'd have said there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要再问一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.00,0:34:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那无名小妞是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that masked chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:34:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  更令人不安的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, the more troubling question would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个姑娘怎么打架比你厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}how come a girl can fight better than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.88,0:35:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个恶魔呢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three demons, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.34,0:35:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起上\N{\fnArial\fs30}At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.89,0:35:07.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你晚上能睡得着就行  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes to get you through the night, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想要个让人不安的问题  我有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want a troubling question, I got one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.89,0:35:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.56,0:35:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们放出了七宗罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we let out the seven deadly sins,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.39,0:35:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们还放出了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else did we let out?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  这问题是让人不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, that is troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.45,0:35:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you gents around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.83,0:35:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.54,0:35:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界现在可怕多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}World just got a lot scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.09,0:35:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.18,0:35:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们多留意预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes peeled for omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.27,0:35:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我也会的  - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll do the same. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.94,0:35:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能赢得这场战争吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can win this war, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.20,0:36:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you on the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.93,0:36:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  或许去路易斯安那州吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I was thinking Louisiana, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在还不到狂欢节吧  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Little early for Mardi Gras, isn't it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.73,0:36:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我刚刚跟塔玛拉聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I was talking to Tamara...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.90,0:36:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她提到什里夫波特城外有个女巫术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she mentioned this Hoodoo priestess just outside Shreveport...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.98,0:36:43.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她或许能帮我们解决你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might be able to help us out, you know, with your...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.23,0:36:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your demon deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.49,0:36:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思"不了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, "Nah?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.45,0:36:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  巫术是无法打破这个交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no Hoodoo spell's gonna break this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是白跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.99,0:36:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不能确定  - 我们确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but we don't know that. - Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧  她帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, she can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.75,0:36:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这值得...  - 我们不去  就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look it's worth... - We're not going and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里诺怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Reno?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.58,0:37:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.42,0:37:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.96,0:37:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直很努力地对你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been bending over backwards trying to be nice to you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.38,0:37:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.26,0:37:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没坚持多久呢  - 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That didn't last long. - Yeah. Well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.26,0:37:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在努力保住你的命  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been busting my ass trying to keep you alive, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.31,0:37:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却一副毫不在乎的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you act like you couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.18,0:37:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你是想死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You got some kind of death wish or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.77,0:37:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是那样的  - 那是什么样  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's not like that. - Then what's it like, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.56,0:37:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 萨姆  - 拜托  告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam... - Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.57,0:37:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们困住一个十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We trapped a Crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欺骗它  想办法钻交易的空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick it, try to welch our way out of the deal in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.16,0:37:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.74,0:37:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.53,0:37:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是交易条件  没法绕过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the terms. There's no way out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢想办法  上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try to find a way, so help me God,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.71,0:37:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会阻止你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能做这个交易  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you make that deal, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.80,0:37:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我受不了你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I couldn't live with you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.97,0:37:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 做不到  - 那现在是我活  你死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couldn't do it. - So, what now? I live and you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.01,0:37:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the general idea, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.55,0:37:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是个伪君子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you're a hypocrite, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.22,0:37:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸为你出卖灵魂时你是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you feel when Dad sold his soul for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.18,0:38:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我可记得你当时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I was there. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.06,0:38:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你痛苦不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were twisted and broken
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.48,0:38:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你又做了同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you go and do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的做法很自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did was selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的  是很自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right, it was selfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.41,0:38:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我介意  - 没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - Tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.16,0:38:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑到我为这个家做的一切  我觉得我有这权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything I've done for this family, I think I'm entitled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.12,0:38:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话  我累了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I'm tired, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.54,0:38:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  感觉就像隧道尽头有了光亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's like there's a light at the end of the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.92,0:38:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是地狱烈火  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hellfire, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.00,0:38:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.22,0:38:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好久以来第一次感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel good for the first time in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.47,0:38:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有一年活头了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a year to live, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.98,0:38:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想好好利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.10,0:38:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样  我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.85,0:38:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.69,0:38:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真让人难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.15,0:38:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very true.

